Licensing status and scope
==========================

This repository does not currently have one confirmed license covering every
included component. The notices below preserve known grants and identify the
remaining uncertainty; they do not grant rights on behalf of other authors.

1. Historical upstream code

   Code traceable to the YummyAnime plugin published with the MIT license at
   commit 227ff5c98b97d95e744e8d3b2211e9debbcc04c2 retains that historical
   grant and its original copyright notice. The unmodified text is in
   LICENSES/MIT-original.txt.

   This notice applies only to material covered by that historical grant.
   It is not a claim that all current files or all later upstream changes
   are licensed under MIT.

2. Original fork contributions

   Original contributions to this fork for which SergeyKlimchuk is entitled
   to grant copyright permissions are offered under the MIT license in
   LICENSES/MIT-fork.txt. This grant does not relicense inherited code or
   third-party materials, and does not expand permissions for those parts.

3. Later upstream changes: license not confirmed

   Upstream removed its LICENSE in commit
   61977a0f81966bd7881956f7ef82ccae799cb9f6 on 2026-08-13. The fork also
   contains later upstream changes, based on commit
   d9cf256500c5d0a1a75de66dbddcc949e997ab5d. A license or permission for
   those later changes has not been confirmed by this repository's audit.

   Their presence here and this notice do not establish permission to use,
   modify or distribute them. A statement from the relevant rights holders
   is needed before treating those changes, or the whole plugin, as MIT.

4. Separately scoped third-party materials

   Native Lampa fixtures in tests/fixtures/lampa-native are accompanied by
   the upstream GPL version 2 license. They are test inputs and are not
   included as player code in the plugin bundle. See LICENSES/GPL-2.0.txt.

   Playwright 1.49.1 is a server dependency under Apache-2.0. The referenced
   license is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0-Playwright.txt. Playwright, its browser
   downloads and node_modules are not vendored in this repository or the
   plugin bundle. Their own notices must be preserved when distributing
   those components; this inventory is not a complete browser/dependency SBOM.

   Logos, posters, illustrations and texts from third-party sources remain
   subject to their respective rights holders' terms. Software licenses in
   this repository do not grant rights to those materials. An ownership
   notice does not replace permission or required image-specific attribution.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licenses.json for sources and component scopes.
The original source history is retained so the provenance can be inspected.
